graph TD
    %% Tryptophan Level Input
    A[Tryptophan in Cell] --> B[Trp-tRNA Charging]
    C[Tryptophan Starvation] --> D[Uncharged Trp-tRNA]
    
    %% Decision: Tryptophan Present?
    B --> E{High Tryptophan?}
    D --> E
    
    %% High Trp Path - Repression
    E -->|Yes| F[Trp Binds TrpR]
    F --> G[TrpR-Trp Complex]
    G --> H[/Active Repressor/]
    H --> I[TrpR Binds Operator]
    I --> J[\Transcription Blocked/]
    J --> K[No trp mRNA]
    K --> L[No Trp Biosynthesis]
    L --> M[Cellular Trp Sufficient]
    
    %% Low Trp Path - Derepression
    E -->|No| N[TrpR Apo-form]
    N --> O[\Inactive Repressor/]
    O --> P[Operator Free]
    P --> Q[RNAP Binds Promoter]
    Q --> R[Transcription Initiation]
    
    %% Leader Peptide Region
    R --> S[Leader Sequence Transcription]
    S --> T[trpL mRNA Synthesis]
    T --> U[Ribosome Binds trpL]
    U --> V[Leader Peptide Translation Starts]
    
    %% Leader Peptide Contains Trp Codons
    V --> W[Two Consecutive Trp Codons]
    W --> X[Ribosome Encounters Trp Codons]
    
    %% Decision: Charged Trp-tRNA Available?
    X --> Y{Charged Trp-tRNA<br/>Available?}
    
    %% AND Gate: Attenuation Decision
    Y -->|No| ANDGATE1{Low Trp AND<br/>Ribosome Stalled?}
    D --> ANDGATE1
    
    %% Ribosome Stalls - Antitermination
    ANDGATE1 -->|Yes| Z[Ribosome Stalls at Trp Codons]
    Z --> AA[Region 1 Free]
    AA --> AB["/Regions 2:3 Form Antiterminator"]
    AB --> AC[Transcription Continues]
    AC --> AD[trpE Gene Transcription]
    AC --> AE[Full Operon Transcription]
    
    %% High Trp Path - Termination
    Y -->|Yes| AF[Ribosome Translates Rapidly]
    AF --> AG[Ribosome Covers Region 1]
    AG --> AH["/Regions 3:4 Form Terminator"]
    AH --> AI[/Terminator Hairpin/]
    AI --> AJ[/Transcription Terminates/]
    AJ --> AK[No trp Structural Genes]
    AK --> AL[No Biosynthesis]
    
    %% AND Gate: Full Transcription
    AD --> ANDGATE2[/Antiterminator AND<br/>RNAP Continues?/]
    AC --> ANDGATE2
    ANDGATE2 -->|Yes| AM[trpE mRNA]
    AM --> AN[trpD mRNA]
    AN --> AO[/trpC mRNA/]
    AO --> AP[trpB mRNA]
    AP --> AQ[trpA mRNA]
    
    %% Translation of Biosynthetic Enzymes
    AM --> AR[TrpE Translation]
    AN --> AS[TrpD Translation]
    AO --> AT[TrpC Translation]
    AP --> AU[TrpB Translation]
    AQ --> AV[TrpA Translation]
    
    %% Enzyme Production
    AR --> AW[Anthranilate Synthase Component I]
    AS --> AX[Anthranilate Synthase Component II]
    AT --> AY[Indole-3-glycerol Phosphate Synthase]
    AU --> AZ[Tryptophan Synthase β]
    AV --> BA[Tryptophan Synthase α]
    
    %% Tryptophan Biosynthesis Pathway
    AW --> BB[Chorismate to Anthranilate]
    AX --> BB
    BB --> BC[Anthranilate to PRPP]
    AY --> BD[PRPP to Indole-glycerol-P]
    BD --> BE[Indole-glycerol-P to Indole]
    AZ --> BF[Indole + Serine]
    BA --> BF
    BF --> BG[Tryptophan Synthesis]
    BG --> BH[Tryptophan Product]
    
    %% Feedback
    BH --> BI[Cellular Trp Pool Restored]
    BI --> BJ[Feedback to TrpR]
    BJ --> F
    
    %% System Outputs
    M --> BK[High Trp State]
    AL --> BL[\Trp Synthesis Blocked/]
    BI --> BM[Trp Homeostasis]
    
